# 仅适用于 PC2 的专用控制转发账号。按本机 sshd 的配置布局登记并核对有效规则。
Match User a2-cockpit-control
    AuthenticationMethods publickey
    PubkeyAuthentication yes
    PasswordAuthentication no
    KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
    AllowAgentForwarding no
    AllowStreamLocalForwarding no
    AllowTcpForwarding local
    PermitOpen 127.0.0.1:18777 127.0.0.1:18778
    PermitListen none
    GatewayPorts no
    PermitTTY no
    PermitTunnel no
    PermitUserRC no
    X11Forwarding no
    # 转发不需要 SSH 会话。零值拒绝命令、PTY 和子系统。
    MaxSessions 0
Match all
